{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794539998332,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2eb13a0002jwFYaqcGOBn3fY","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","messageID":"msg_1d2eb01ee0016H8L8B5xUTcL6i","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-985316729c2f7f17","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"runId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns defer or routes to a mode with no command, and the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer\",\"findingsCount\":6,\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"noveltyJustification\":\"5 of 6 findings are new (delivered-versus-captured offer gap, hub-only offer path, per-row hub verdicts, deep-family double miss, two-part rule) and 1 is a partial restatement of the known deep-review defer.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\",\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\",\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\",\"Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\",\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Lowering COMMAND_MEANING_MIN_COSINE to lift create rows\",\"Ranking a top-3 command row into the brief instead of the top skill\",\"Treating the capture offered flag as a delivered offer\"],\"focusTrack\":\"offer-reach\",\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\",\"Glob\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json\",\".skilled/bin/compiled-route.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T03:19:14.000Z\",\"durationMs\":300000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-hub-offer\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which plain rows miss because a hub defers or routes to a command-less mode\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-hub-only-path\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"All five delivered plain offers travel through a compiled hub route or the doctor handoff\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q1-f1\",\"source\":\"f-hub-only-path\",\"target\":\"q-hub-offer\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"The chat set has 16 plain tune rows; the after arm delivered 5 offers (3 create, 2 doctor helper) and none on 11, while the capture marks 6 offered because it counts top-3 command presence and the renderer prints only the top plus a doctor companion.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:520\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"label\":\"Every delivered plain offer travels through a compiled hub route attached to a top skill or through the doctor helper handoff; no delivered offer comes from a command row outranking its owner on a plain prompt.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:300\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:846\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"label\":\"On 9 create-family chat rows the sk-doc hub routes single to a command mode on 3, clarifies 1, defers 4 and routes 1 to a command-less quality-control mode, so the hub is the bottleneck on 6 of 9 rather than the attach layer.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\",\".skilled/bin/compiled-route.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"label\":\"Hub vocabulary is paraphrase-blind: it matches the corpus phrasing that already passes and misses ordinary rewordings such as agent definition, persona file, document before and after my rewrite, overview page and hub skill, so each miss falls to defer.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"label\":\"The deep family misses twice: the deep hub defers on the research row, the review row's top sk-code route lands on a command-less sk-code-review mode, and the doctor-deep-loop row routes to research but the depth gate suppresses it while no doctor mode exists.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:252\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"label\":\"The smallest hub-side rule is paraphrase alias widening plus a defer-time offer restricted to the leading mode's ask or read-only run command, never a start command, with none of the proposed phrases present in the 31 readable none rows.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\"]}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns defer or routes to a mode with no command, and the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":6,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.9,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"5 of 6 findings are new (delivered-versus-captured offer gap, hub-only offer path, per-row hub verdicts, deep-family double miss, two-part rule) and 1 is a partial restatement of the known deep-review defer.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\\\",\\\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\\\",\\\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\\\",\\\"Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\\\",\\\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Lowering COMMAND_MEANING_MIN_COSINE to lift create rows\\\",\\\"Ranking a top-3 command row into the brief instead of the top skill\\\",\\\"Treating the capture offered flag as a delivered offer\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"offer-reach\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Glob\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/compiled-route.cjs\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-13T03:19:14.000Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":300000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-hub-offer\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Which plain rows miss because a hub defers or routes to a command-less mode\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-hub-only-path\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"All five delivered plain offers travel through a compiled hub route or the doctor handoff\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-q1-f1\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-hub-only-path\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-hub-offer\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The chat set has 16 plain tune rows; the after arm delivered 5 offers (3 create, 2 doctor helper) and none on 11, while the capture marks 6 offered because it counts top-3 command presence and the renderer prints only the top plus a doctor companion.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:520\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Every delivered plain offer travels through a compiled hub route attached to a top skill or through the doctor helper handoff; no delivered offer comes from a command row outranking its owner on a plain prompt.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:300\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:846\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"On 9 create-family chat rows the sk-doc hub routes single to a command mode on 3, clarifies 1, defers 4 and routes 1 to a command-less quality-control mode, so the hub is the bottleneck on 6 of 9 rather than the attach layer.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/compiled-route.cjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Hub vocabulary is paraphrase-blind: it matches the corpus phrasing that already passes and misses ordinary rewordings such as agent definition, persona file, document before and after my rewrite, overview page and hub skill, so each miss falls to defer.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The deep family misses twice: the deep hub defers on the research row, the review row's top sk-code route lands on a command-less sk-code-review mode, and the doctor-deep-loop row routes to research but the depth gate suppresses it while no doctor mode exists.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:252\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The smallest hub-side rule is paraphrase alias widening plus a defer-time offer restricted to the leading mode's ask or read-only run command, never a start command, with none of the proposed phrases present in the 31 readable none rows.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\\\"]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794539983776,"end":1794539998332}}}}
