adding a false offer?\n- [ ] How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\n- [ ] What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\n- [ ] Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\n- [ ] Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\nHow much of the remaining gap is score placement versus evidence absence on the 5 rows whose top skill is not the owner (create-command, create-goal, create-manual-playbook, deep-review, doctor-deep-loop)?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.9,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:66801f75bb6218e3f2a7acfb983736c17078027700bd969f41798e135eee549d:ruled-out:1\",\"legacy-jsonl:66801f75bb6218e3f2a7acfb983736c17078027700bd969f41798e135eee549d:ruled-out:2\",\"legacy-jsonl:66801f75bb6218e3f2a7acfb983736c17078027700bd969f41798e135eee549d:ruled-out:3\"],\"focus\":\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns defer or routes to a mode with no command, and the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T03:19:14.000Z\"}\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\n- [ ] How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\n- [ ] What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\n- [ ] Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\n- [ ] Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\nHow much of the remaining gap is score placement versus evidence absence on the 5 rows whose top skill is not the owner (create-command, create-goal, create-manual-playbook, deep-review, doctor-deep-loop)?\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach && jq -c 'select(.type==\\\"iteration\\\")' $L/deep-research-state.jsonl && sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' $L/deep-research-strategy.md && sed -n '/ANCHOR:next-focus/,/\\\\/ANCHOR:next-focus/p' $L/deep-research-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540014760,"end":1794540015474}}}}
