d at 0 of 44 and doctor reach at 0 of 17, The operator closed the phase Complete on 2026-11-12, with each unmet criterion waived, superseded or carried to a later phase.\"\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md:60:A prompt typed in plain words now reaches its slash command on 9 of 45 tune rows, up from 0 of 44. No new false offer appeared, and full corpus top 1 rose from 158 to 159. The paraphrased holdout rows still reach nothing, and the doctor rows reach nothing on either split. The operator closed the phase Complete on 2026-11-12 and settled every criterion it did not meet, as Known Limitations lists.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md:66:Measured in `command-routing-baseline.json` after today's later fixes, own row plus attached reach on tune is 9 of 45: own 2 and attached 7. Holdout is 0 of 44, and doctor is 0 of 17 on tune. Typed recall at 1 went from 19 to 24 of 44, and slash variants reached from 2 to 5 of 8. The corpus now holds 176 rows: 45 tune, 44 holdout and 87 with no split.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md:140:| Add `persona file` to the sk-doc agent aliases, then remove it again | It attached `/create:agent` to an unrelated prompt, \"update the customer persona file for the marketing site\". The row `cmd-create-agent-plain-tune-02` now gets no command where it once got the wrong one, and tune combined reach went from 10 to 9 of 45 |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md:159:| Plain reach, `command-routing-baseline.json` | Tune 9 of 45 (own 2, attached 7). Holdout 0 of 44. `scratch/after.json` held 9 of 44 before the router fix |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/0