{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540118897,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2ecfb0f001g7WUohhgA8WFvV","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","messageID":"msg_1d2eceb5c001qcSO3B0TBSRxwX","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ba2efbc98b4dd66e","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"runId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Placement versus evidence absence on the five wrong-top plain rows, and what the semantic lane actually buys\",\"findingsCount\":6,\"newInfoRatio\":0.85,\"noveltyJustification\":\"5 findings are new (per-row semantic gain, meaning-gate mechanics, four-of-five evidence classification, the phase 003 alias regression, the metadata re-embed lever) and 1 is a partial restatement of the explicit anchor idea from iteration 1.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\",\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\",\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\",\"Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\",\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\",\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Lowering COMMAND_MEANING_MIN_COSINE\",\"Raising the semantic lane weight\",\"Re-adding persona file as an agent alias\",\"Threshold tuning as a substitute for per-row evidence\"],\"focusTrack\":\"offer-reach\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/real-embedding-after.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T03:25:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":300000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-placement\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Placement versus evidence absence per wrong-top row\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-evidence\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Four of five wrong-top rows are evidence absence and a lower threshold reaches none\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q2-f1\",\"source\":\"f-evidence\",\"target\":\"q-placement\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-001\",\"label\":\"The real embedder lifts plain tune recall from 9 to 14 of 45, but the five gained rows are doctor env, doctor git, doctor symlink, speckit handoff and speckit plan, none in the 16-row chat set whose delivered offers are all attached.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/real-embedding-after.json\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-002\",\"label\":\"A command passes on meaning only at a real cosine of 0.72 with a 0.02 lead over the strongest other command, and the semantic lane weight is 0.05; the embedded text is the skill row's name, description, domains, intent signals and derived triggers from the skill-graph DB.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:846\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts:322\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"label\":\"Four of five wrong-top rows are evidence absence: create-command lacks a command phrase and loses to the prompt token, create-goal lacks intent-file evidence, create-manual requires a literal playbook phrase, and deep-review has audit lifting sk-code with no deep-loop phrase; only create-agent-01 is placement-like.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts:28\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:827\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"label\":\"Phase 003 already added and removed the persona file alias because it wrong-offered /create:agent on a marketing persona prompt and dropped tune combined reach from 10 to 9, so generic alias widening is a measured dead end.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md:140\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"label\":\"The cheapest embedder-independent fix is one multi-word explicit anchor per row, such as agent definition, prompt shortcut, intent file, test script package, many passes and findings stop changing, each absent from the 31 readable none rows.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts:92\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"label\":\"The only generalizing lever is adding paraphrase exemplars to the command rows' intent signals and re-embedding the skill graph, which this lineage cannot measure because running the embedder is out of scope.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts:349\"]}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-002.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":2,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Placement versus evidence absence on the five wrong-top plain rows, and what the semantic lane actually buys\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":6,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.85,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"5 findings are new (per-row semantic gain, meaning-gate mechanics, four-of-five evidence classification, the phase 003 alias regression, the metadata re-embed lever) and 1 is a partial restatement of the explicit anchor idea from iteration 1.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\\\",\\\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\\\",\\\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\\\",\\\"Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\\\",\\\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\\\",\\\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Lowering COMMAND_MEANING_MIN_COSINE\\\",\\\"Raising the semantic lane weight\\\",\\\"Re-adding persona file as an agent alias\\\",\\\"Threshold tuning as a substitute for per-row evidence\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"offer-reach\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/real-embedding-after.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-13T03:25:00.000Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":300000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-placement\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Placement versus evidence absence per wrong-top row\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-evidence\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Four of five wrong-top rows are evidence absence and a lower threshold reaches none\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-q2-f1\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-evidence\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-placement\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The real embedder lifts plain tune recall from 9 to 14 of 45, but the five gained rows are doctor env, doctor git, doctor symlink, speckit handoff and speckit plan, none in the 16-row chat set whose delivered offers are all attached.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/scratch/real-embedding-after.json\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A command passes on meaning only at a real cosine of 0.72 with a 0.02 lead over the strongest other command, and the semantic lane weight is 0.05; the embedded text is the skill row's name, description, domains, intent signals and derived triggers from the skill-graph DB.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:846\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts:322\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Four of five wrong-top rows are evidence absence: create-command lacks a command phrase and loses to the prompt token, create-goal lacks intent-file evidence, create-manual requires a literal playbook phrase, and deep-review has audit lifting sk-code with no deep-loop phrase; only create-agent-01 is placement-like.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts:28\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:827\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Phase 003 already added and removed the persona file alias because it wrong-offered /create:agent on a marketing persona prompt and dropped tune combined reach from 10 to 9, so generic alias widening is a measured dead end.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/003-plain-chat-command-reach/implementation-summary.md:140\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The cheapest embedder-independent fix is one multi-word explicit anchor per row, such as agent definition, prompt shortcut, intent file, test script package, many passes and findings stop changing, each absent from the 31 readable none rows.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts:92\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The only generalizing lever is adding paraphrase exemplars to the command rows' intent signals and re-embedding the skill graph, which this lineage cannot measure because running the embedder is out of scope.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts:349\\\"]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540108559,"end":1794540118897}}}}
