{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540340622,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2f065290018XEwh9vNq2uNK6","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","messageID":"msg_1d2f05d110019qK9SMVSTipEIp","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b44a78731a588af9","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Verify every proposed phrase and mechanism against the none rows and hub canary, compute expected exact-offer gain, check floors and rank the recommendations\",\"findingsCount\":6,\"newInfoRatio\":0.7,\"noveltyJustification\":\"4 findings are new (measured zero-collision counts, two-artifact sk-doc cost, doctor default-invocation requirement, asymmetric floor exposure) and 2 are partially new syntheses of the expected-gain table and the ranking.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\",\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\",\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\",\"Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\",\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Shipping an ungrephed phrase\",\"Hand-editing the compiled policy snapshot\",\"Folding the metadata re-embed into the same phase\"],\"focusTrack\":\"offer-reach\",\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\",\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/007-sk-doc/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/scoring-constants.ts\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T03:38:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":300000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-floors\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Which threshold or constant moves offer rate and what is its floor risk\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-floors\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"False offers are protected by measured phrase absence while typed and scorer floors need a re-pin\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-q5-f1\",\"source\":\"f-floors\",\"target\":\"q-floors\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"label\":\"All 17 proposed phrases return 0 matches across the 31 none prompts, so the pinned false-offer set cannot move by construction and the residual risk is only an unseen paraphrase.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"label\":\"An sk-doc vocabulary change is a two-artifact change, the hub source and the compiled policy snapshot, and the 22-case canary already pins one-turn-clarify and zero-signal-defer.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/007-sk-doc/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json\",\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/014-runtime-engine/lib/compiled-route.cjs:36\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"label\":\"The matched doctor command needs its default invocation carried on the match because the base /doctor:agents-md has no policy row; the route manifest marks check as the read-only default, ci report read-only and deep-loop add-only under policy run.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:512\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:87\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"label\":\"Expected exact offers rise from 3 to 14 plus 2 conversions across the 16 chat rows, covering all 11 missing rows on paper: deep hub +3, sk-doc +3, explicit anchors +3, doctor +2 new and 2 conversions.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"label\":\"Floor exposure is asymmetric: false offers are protected by phrase absence, typed recall is exposed through PHRASE_BOOSTS reordering and must be re-pinned, and the scorer eval can move either way so the calibration override is the dry-run surface.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/scoring-constants.ts:254\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"label\":\"Ranking by new exact offers plus half a conversion over a risk weight puts deep hub aliases and the doctor cluster first at 3.0, sk-doc aliases at 2.0, explicit anchors at 1.5 and the metadata re-embed last.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json\"]}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-offer-reach-1794539443568-6stapj\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":4,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify every proposed phrase and mechanism against the none rows and hub canary, compute expected exact-offer gain, check floors and rank the recommendations\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":6,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.7,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"4 findings are new (measured zero-collision counts, two-artifact sk-doc cost, doctor default-invocation requirement, asymmetric floor exposure) and 2 are partially new syntheses of the expected-gain table and the ranking.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which plain tune rows get no offer because a hub returns `defer` (or routes to a mode with no command), and what is the smallest rule that turns a deferring hub prompt into an offer without adding a false offer?\\\",\\\"How much of the 3-of-16 plain offer rate is score placement (the command row or owner below the top-1 threshold) versus evidence absence (no lane, no phrase, no embedding text), measured per row?\\\",\\\"What does the semantic lane contribute to the plain tune rows, and does a wording or weight change raise offers without moving the scorer floors?\\\",\\\"Which doctor-family strings can ever score a document read, and how much plain recall is lost to the argued-route/document lookup rather than to scoring?\\\",\\\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which threshold or ranking constant could move the plain offer rate, and what is its measured risk to false offers 0 of 35 and typed recall 24 of 44?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Shipping an ungrephed phrase\\\",\\\"Hand-editing the compiled policy snapshot\\\",\\\"Folding the metadata re-embed into the same phase\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"offer-reach\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/007-sk-doc/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/scoring-constants.ts\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-13T03:38:00.000Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":300000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-floors\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Which threshold or constant moves offer rate and what is its floor risk\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-floors\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"False offers are protected by measured phrase absence while typed and scorer floors need a re-pin\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-q5-f1\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-floors\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-floors\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"All 17 proposed phrases return 0 matches across the 31 none prompts, so the pinned false-offer set cannot move by construction and the residual risk is only an unseen paraphrase.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-prompts.jsonl\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"An sk-doc vocabulary change is a two-artifact change, the hub source and the compiled policy snapshot, and the 22-case canary already pins one-turn-clarify and zero-signal-defer.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/009-parent-hub-rollout/007-sk-doc/fixtures/canary-cases.v1.json\\\",\\\".skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/014-runtime-engine/lib/compiled-route.cjs:36\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The matched doctor command needs its default invocation carried on the match because the base /doctor:agents-md has no policy row; the route manifest marks check as the read-only default, ci report read-only and deep-loop add-only under policy run.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:512\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:87\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Expected exact offers rise from 3 to 14 plus 2 conversions across the 16 chat rows, covering all 11 missing rows on paper: deep hub +3, sk-doc +3, explicit anchors +3, doctor +2 new and 2 conversions.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Floor exposure is asymmetric: false offers are protected by phrase absence, typed recall is exposed through PHRASE_BOOSTS reordering and must be re-pinned, and the scorer eval can move either way so the calibration override is the dry-run surface.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/scoring-constants.ts:254\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-command-routing-baseline.mjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Ranking by new exact offers plus half a conversion over a risk weight puts deep hub aliases and the doctor cluster first at 3.0, sk-doc aliases at 2.0, explicit anchors at 1.5 and the metadata re-embed last.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/hub-router.json\\\"]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540332329,"end":1794540340622}}}}
