{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540521409,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2f341a1001o8j0DAKTaM8o4q","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc122ffeqzrRrTg65W0LsJ","messageID":"msg_1d2f33272001826S127KKrHKfZ","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bcbe5bc8d93ac93","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git status --porcelain -- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research | grep -v 'research/lineages/offer-reach/' | head -20; echo \"OUTSIDE_LINEAGE_CHANGES_ABOVE\"; echo \"---dashboard---\"; head -20 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deep-research-dashboard.md; echo \"---research sections---\"; grep -n '^## ' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/research.md"},"output":" M specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/observability-events.jsonl\n?? specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/deep-research-config-segment-2.json\n?? specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/\n?? specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-2/\nOUTSIDE_LINEAGE_CHANGES_ABOVE\n---dashboard---\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: SEGMENT TWO offer-reach lane: find the next improvements to command surfacing now that phases 005, 006, 008 and 010 are built and committed and phase 011 (typed command delivery 44 of 44, policy on hub-attached commands, visibility guard, hook health, brief cost script) is being built, without re-recommending what those phases built or plan. Explain and improve the measured offer bottleneck: the expected command was offered on only 3 of the 16 plain tune rows, /doctor:helper on 2 more and nothing on 11, while a command that was offered was usually taken; plain recall on the tune split is 9 of 45 on phrases and 14 of 45 with the real embedder. Lane label offer-reach covers hub mode vocabulary and deferral (/deep:review and /deep:research defer, so three runtimes improvise), a default command for a hub that defers, semantic lane weight and embedding text, the doctor family, and scoring thresholds, while false offers stay 0 of 35 and typed recall stays at least 24 of 44 and the scorer floors stay [159,50,20,5].\n- Started: 2026-11-13T10:00:00.000Z\n- Status: COMPLETE\n---research sections---\n9:## 1. Executive Summary\n19:## 2. Scope, Evidence Lanes, Terminology\n26:## 3. Measured State\n41:## 4. Offer Path Inventory\n53:## 5. Findings — Why the Plain Offer Rate Is Capped\n61:## 6. Findings — The Doctor Family\n68:## 7. Findings — The Semantic Lane and Cost\n74:## 8. Cross-check Against Built Phases\n84:## 9. Ranked Recommendations\n98:## 10. Eliminated Alternatives\n110:## Divergence Map\n114:## 12. Open Questions\n124:## 13. References\n136:## 14. Answered Questions\n144:## 15. Limitations and Confidence\n152:## 16. Implementation Decision\n156:## 17. Convergence Report\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":" M specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/observability-events.jsonl\n?? specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/deep-research-config-segment-2.json\n?? specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/\n?? specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-cost-2/\nOUTSIDE_LINEAGE_CHANGES_ABOVE\n---dashboard---\n---\ntitle: Deep Research Dashboard\ndescription: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n---\n\n# Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n\nAuto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: SEGMENT TWO offer-reach lane: find the next improvements to command surfacing now that phases 005, 006, 008 and 010 are built and committed and phase 011 (typed command delivery 44 of 44, policy on hub-attached commands, visibility guard, hook health, brief cost script) is being built, without re-recommending what those phases built or plan. Explain and improve the measured offer bottleneck: the expected command was offered on only 3 of the 16 plain tune rows, /doctor:helper on 2 more and nothing on 11, while a command that was offered was usually taken; plain recall on the tune split is 9 of 45 on phrases and 14 of 45 with the real embedder. Lane label offer-reach covers hub mode vocabulary and deferral (/deep:review and /deep:research defer, so three runtimes improvise), a default command for a hub that defers, semantic lane weight and embedding text, the doctor family, and scoring thresholds, while false offers stay 0 of 35 and typed recall stays at least 24 of 44 and the scorer floors stay [159,50,20,5].\n- Started: 2026-11-13T10:00:00.000Z\n- Status: COMPLETE\n---research sections---\n9:## 1. Executive Summary\n19:## 2. Scope, Evidence Lanes, Terminology\n26:## 3. Measured State\n41:## 4. Offer Path Inventory\n53:## 5. Findings — Why the Plain Offer Rate Is Capped\n61:## 6. Findings — The Doctor Family\n68:## 7. Findings — The Semantic Lane and Cost\n74:## 8. Cross-check Against Built Phases\n84:## 9. Ranked Recommendations\n98:## 10. Eliminated Alternatives\n110:## Divergence Map\n114:## 12. Open Questions\n124:## 13. References\n136:## 14. Answered Questions\n144:## 15. Limitations and Confidence\n152:## 16. Implementation Decision\n156:## 17. Convergence Report\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git status --porcelain -- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research | grep -v 'research/lineages/offer-reach/' | head -20; echo \\\"OUTSIDE_LINEAGE_CHANGES_ABOVE\\\"; echo \\\"---dashboard---\\\"; head -20 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/deep-research-dashboard.md; echo \\\"---research sections---\\\"; grep -n '^## ' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/offer-reach/research.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540519841,"end":1794540521409}}}}
